{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_0813E0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"足球这项运动在中美洲很受欢迎。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":45,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"<R=美国,STATES>虽然还不算流行，但在<R=中南美洲,LATIN AMERICA>却拥有狂热的球迷。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=美国,STATES>\", \"<R=中南美洲,LATIN AMERICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"甚至有人说，1969年萨尔瓦多和洪都拉斯之间爆发的战争，就是由足球比赛中的冲突引起的。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"实际上，两国原本就关系紧张，足球似乎只是其中一个导火索……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"但这种说法能被传得煞有介事，也足以说明中美洲人有多痴迷足球。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"这里的士兵里也有很多球迷，于是他们决定分成哥斯达黎加队和尼加拉瓜队来一场比赛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"踢足球除了球还需要球门，据说研发班做了简易球门，装在甲板上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"我本来毫无兴趣，但Chico邀请我去看，我也只好去了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"场地大小也不正规，比赛相当随便，可球员和啦啦队都很兴奋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"大家敲着空罐头和自制扩音器，气氛简直像过节一样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"担任裁判的Huey吹响哨子，比赛开始了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"士兵们平时都经过训练，身体素质很好，但毕竟不是职业球员，技术还很粗糙，粗野动作也不少。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"中途，两名球员相撞，其中一人受了伤。双方差点因此吵起来，好在Huey出面调解。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"“我们不是已经抛弃国家，与这个星球融为一体了吗？”Huey这么说。那是Snake说过的话。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"“我们不是在争哪个国家更优秀，也不是为了国家利益而战。”","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"“这不是战争。足球是和平的运动，对吧？”士兵们听了Huey这番话，都点了点头。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"他们了解战争的痛苦，也认同Snake。也许正因为如此，这些话才让他们有所感触。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"哥斯达黎加队少了一个人，不知为什么，最后竟让我补了进去。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"之前一直是哥斯达黎加占优势，也许Huey是想平衡一下双方。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":79,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"士兵们也赞成Huey的决定。哥斯达黎加队的球员大概也觉得势均力敌更有意思。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"一开始我觉得很麻烦，可在烈日下追着球跑，即使没全力冲刺，也很快就汗流浃背。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"渐渐地，我有点自暴自弃，反而开始认真追起球来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"我在对方阵地深处捡到一个漏球，明明是<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>，Chico却还替我加油，喊着“上！射门！”","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=尼加拉瓜人,NICA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":134,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"我使尽全力踢出的射门，被对方门将挡住了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":24,"cn_text":"这让我很不甘心，反而更加认真起来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":25,"cn_text":"结果我一球未进，哥斯达黎加也被逆转输掉了比赛。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":26,"cn_text":"不过，比赛打得相当胶着。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":27,"cn_text":"我们互相称赞彼此的表现，然后把疲惫的身体摊在甲板的阴凉处。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":28,"cn_text":"强劲的海风吹过发热的身体，感觉很舒服。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":29,"cn_text":"那里似乎也是Nuke最喜欢的地方之一，它也一脸惬意地躺在那里。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":85,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":30,"cn_text":"洁净的蓝天上，层层羊云缓缓飘过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""}]}